  "details": "Vrchat would be more immersive if we had the ability to have a phone and call one another from different worlds. the design I have for this idea is a sleek black default Iphone 15 kinda design, with the ability to customize the phone ( wallpaper , phone color etc) A messages app with custom made VRC emojis like the ones you upload with vrc+.  A call app on the bottom next to messages , able to call/facetime from different instances. A own made tiktok or instagram has The name I have for it is VCHIRP with post made by many different people , able to like the post share to messages so your friends can see. A number that people can call you from ( for example kinda like a apple id ) you’ll see your number , name , and status on vrc.",
